      "text": "Here I go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 15.1,
      "end_time": 16.1,
      "text": "♪ It's time ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 16.2,
      "end_time": 17.2,
      "text": "♪ to start running! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 17.3,
      "end_time": 20.0,
      "text": "♪ Let's go! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 30.1,
      "end_time": 32.5,
      "text": "♪ Believe we're all heroes, ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 32.6,
      "end_time": 35.1,
      "text": "♪ and take the leap! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 35.2,
      "end_time": 37.1,
      "text": "♪ Exceed your limits ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 37.2,
      "end_time": 40.1,
      "text": "♪ each and every day ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 40.3,
      "end_time": 45.2,
      "text": "♪ Abandon your tears to the past ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 45.3,
      "end_time": 52.1,
      "text": "♪ So your chosen path will shine brightly ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 56.5,
      "end_time": 60.2,
      "text": "Oh, the reindeer are all utterly fixated!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 60.7,
      "end_time": 63.4,
      "text": "So this is the brilliance of an idol...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 63.7,
      "end_time": 66.0,
      "text": "Then I too shall indulge..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 68.2,
      "end_time": 69.2,
      "text": "Broough...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 69.2,
      "end_time": 71.7,
      "text": "...with a little added flair, hmm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 72.1,
      "end_time": 74.2,
      "text": "♪ Spread your wings of courage ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 74.3,
      "end_time": 76.7,
      "text": "♪ and fly ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 76.8,
      "end_time": 81.6,
      "text": "♪ We'll make these sparkling moments ours ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 83.0,
      "end_time": 84.5,
      "text": "Brrr... rgh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 85.1,
      "end_time": 86.1,
      "text": "Heheh."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 86.5,
      "end_time": 88.0,
      "text": "Nicely done."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 88.2,
      "end_time": 90.6,
      "text": "Boy, can I ask for an escort?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 96.3,
      "end_time": 97.7,
      "text": "The great Christina is..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 98.0,
